### SURFACE NOTES
Native WinUI 3 parity port of CostSummaryCards.tsx: a responsive 2/3/6-column grid of six cost-economics
tiles (Total Cost, Avg $/kWh, Cost Per Mile/km, Total Energy, Gas Savings $, Savings %), each a bordered
StatBox with a palette-tinted icon chip. The web component is presentational (receives coreStats as a
prop); the native feature-view owns the per-vehicle charging-sessions read (Operations.Charging.Sessions
?vehicle_id, via IWidgetVehicleSource) and aggregates coreStats itself (port of useCostAnalysisData), so it
renders the full mandated state matrix: loading skeleton, loaded grid (TsFadeIn entrance = native mapping
of the web StaggerContainer/StaggerItem), empty (no sessions), error+retry (TsQueryError), and stale /
offline freshness chips. SI energy/distance is converted to the user's units only at the projection
boundary (useUnits); currency symbol + gas price/unit come from settings (useFormatting/useSettings). Every
t() i18n key from the source is reproduced through the ILocalizer facade -- including costAnalysis.stats.
costPerDist ("Cost Per {{unit}}"), which the prompt's auto-extracted key list omitted but the web source
(THE specification) renders. The web miles-as-metres cost-per-distance double-conversion
(convertDistanceFromSI(totalDistanceM / 1609.344, unit)) and the cost_decimal cost field are reproduced
verbatim -- never silently "fixed". Per-tile Narrator names; loading announced via a polite live region.

